#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0090_000_0
#. timeline 27515..28017
#: codec/1/196/0xc4280/22
msgid ""
"I can sympathize with that.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0090_000_0
#. timeline 28100..29312
#: codec/1/196/0xc4280/23
msgid ""
"There's plenty of guerrillas out there who'd rob\n"
"their own people to feed their revolutions.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0090_000_0
#. timeline 29354..31249
#: codec/1/196/0xc4280/24
msgid ""
"If we had a comandante like him, the Sandinistas\n"
"would find the will to fight.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 501..1407
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/0
msgid ""
"You called that giant chopper an \"hombre nuevo\"...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 1407..2201
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/1
msgid ""
"Si. It means \"new man.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 2229..2563
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/2
msgid ""
"\"New man\"?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 2605..3789
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/3
msgid ""
"There was nobody piloting that thing. It must be\n"
"controlled by machine.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 3817..5391
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/4
msgid ""
"Yeah, it seems that way. No human being could pull\n"
"off those crazy maneuvers.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 5433..6561
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/5
msgid ""
"But it's not crazy - it's smart. It sings, too.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 6603..8038
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/6
msgid ""
"When we first saw it, one of my men said, \"Pilot\n"
"must be an hombre nuevo.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 8080..8721
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/7
msgid ""
"Me, I do not like the name.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 8735..8986
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/8
#: codec/1/228/0xe4140/2
msgid ""
"Why?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 9000..10017
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/9
msgid ""
"\"Hombre nuevo\" was what El Che was striving to\n"
"become.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0110_000_1
#. timeline 10058..57662
#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/10
msgid ""
"What all of us who joined the Sandinistas strive to\n"
"become. That's why!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/11
msgid ""
"An hombre nuevo is one who finds joy in virtue\n"
"and voluntary labor...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/12
msgid ""
"It makes me furious to see the name given to such\n"
"a monster.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/196/0xc4bb0/13
msgid ""
"I'll bet.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 459..1198
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/0
msgid ""
"Chico called that helicopter el colibri...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 1253..2229
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/1
msgid ""
"Our name for the hummingbird. You saw how that\n"
"chopper moved...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 2270..2856
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/2
msgid ""
"how it hovered in midair like a hummingbird.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 2911..3650
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/3
msgid ""
"Hell've a lot bigger than a bird, though.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 3691..4500
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/4
msgid ""
"True. But better than hombre nuevo, don't you\n"
"think?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 4555..5419
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/5
msgid ""
"When you get kidnapped by el colibri, it's all over.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 5503..6673
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/6
msgid ""
"They take you to a prison camp, and torture you\n"
"until you snitch on your compas.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 6715..7202
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/7
msgid ""
"That's what took Chico...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 7244..8484
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/8
msgid ""
"They have no mercy. Once you've talked, they toss\n"
"you out like trash...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 8582..9459
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/9
msgid ""
"I knew this, and still I could not save Chico.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 9613..10616
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/10
msgid ""
"If he cannot be saved, I'll do what must be done...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 10671..11187
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/11
msgid ""
"Don't write him off like that.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 11270..12538
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/12
msgid ""
"Sometimes you have to survive, even if it means\n"
"sacrificing your honor.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0120_000_1
#. timeline 12594..13486
#: codec/1/197/0xc5060/13
msgid ""
"I'll get him back. I promise.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I need your opinion. How strong are the\n"
"enemy's mercenaries?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/1
msgid ""
"They're well trained. They've got more than enough\n"
"men...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/2
msgid ""
"Seasoned, too - a lot of them probably saw action\n"
"in Vietnam. They're a tough bunch.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/3
msgid ""
"And armed to the teeth.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/4
msgid ""
"I don't think I've ever seen a mercenary force field\n"
"that many tanks and attack choppers.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/5
msgid ""
"It shows how much cash they have to throw\n"
"around.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/6
msgid ""
"And connections - how did they get access to\n"
"such weapons?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/7
msgid ""
"How do you think? They're backed by the one and\n"
"only CIA.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/8
msgid ""
"And here we are, half of us farmers and the other\n"
"half students. Children, even!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/9
msgid ""
"And weapons... We're so short on guns we have to\n"
"steal them from the enemy.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/10
msgid ""
"As much as I hate to say it, we're always going to\n"
"be on the defensive.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/12
msgid ""
"And mi viejo... Without him, we...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice 
#. timeline 16258..16690
#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/13
#: codec/2/903/0x3879e0/15
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/14
msgid ""
"...I don't know if we can win.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/15
msgid ""
"Can we, Snake?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/16
msgid ""
"Stop feeling sorry for yourself.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/17
#: codec/2/905/0x389770/4
#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/48
msgid ""
"But...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/18
msgid ""
"Amanda!\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_chc0070_020_0
#. timeline 4959..5099
#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_ccl0130_000_0
#. timeline 3761..3914
#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 417..557
#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/19
#: codec/1/209/0xd17b0/3
#: codec/1/234/0xea890/3
#: codec/1/250/0xfa640/17
#: codec/1/255/0xff000/8
#: codec/2/902/0x3861c0/21
#: codec/2/904/0x388570/13
#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/46
#: codec/2/914/0x392460/12
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/1
msgid ""
"What?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/20
msgid ""
"Listen to me. Don't ever let your men hear you talk\n"
"like that.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/21
msgid ""
"...I...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/22
msgid ""
"You're their leader, and a leader has to stand tall.\n"
"Even when times get tough.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/23
msgid ""
"When it feels like the fear and uncertainty could\n"
"crush you.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/24
msgid ""
"You're the one your comrades look to for\n"
"reassurance. That's what a leader is. Don't forget it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/25
msgid ""
"...Snake...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/26
msgid ""
"If you're looking for comfort, go find a church.\n"
"That's all I've got to say.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/27
msgid ""
"You are right. I am sorry. I need to pull myself\n"
"together.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/197/0xc5540/28
msgid ""
"You'll be fine. I know you have it in you.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/0
msgid ""
"The land in our country belongs to us, and yet it\n"
"doesn't belong to us.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/2
msgid ""
"Along the coast, it is all banana groves. And in the\n"
"mountains, it is coffee.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/3
msgid ""
"I guess in that way it's not so different from here.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/4
msgid ""
"Plantations...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/5
msgid ""
"Almost all the bananas and coffee are sold as\n"
"exports.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/6
msgid ""
"The landlords keep the money for themselves,\n"
"leaving precious little to the farmers.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/7
msgid ""
"Worse, the biggest landowners in the country are\n"
"Somoza and his family.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/8
msgid ""
"But it does bring in foreign currency...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/9
msgid ""
"I doubt even that, at least for bananas. The\n"
"plantations are owned by American corporations.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/10
msgid ""
"The bananas are processed in factories on the\n"
"plantations and exported to America from private\n"
"ports...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/11
msgid ""
"It's like having little American enclaves along the\n"
"coast of Nicaragua.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/12
msgid ""
"But the farmers have no choice but to go work\n"
"there...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/13
msgid ""
"Es ridículo! The people have to take their land\n"
"back.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc62d0/14
msgid ""
"It is one of the things we're fighting for.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/0
msgid ""
"Tell me... when exactly did you realize your dad\n"
"was working with the KGB?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/1
msgid ""
"About six months ago. Up until then, we only had\n"
"beans to eat.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/2
msgid ""
"And then suddenly we started to get eggs and\n"
"flour. Our bullet shortage simply disappeared.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/3
msgid ""
"How'd he get the cocaine?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/4
msgid ""
"Ask the KGB. All we did here was process it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/5
msgid ""
"Coca plants grow here, too,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/6
msgid ""
"but to my knowledge almost all of the stuff we\n"
"used came from Colombia and Bolivia.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/7
msgid ""
"It's processed in a factory and then shipped to\n"
"ports on the Caribbean Sea.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/8
msgid ""
"Where does it go after that?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/9
msgid ""
"I never thought about it.... I mean, I did not want to\n"
"think about it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/10
msgid ""
"The biggest cocaine consumer in the world is the\n"
"United States.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/11
msgid ""
"I'm guessing they smuggle it in on vessels\n"
"disguised as fishing boats.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/12
msgid ""
"Wait. La CIA uses that route, too.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/13
msgid ""
"Are you telling me they're selling cocaine to their\n"
"own country?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/14
msgid ""
"Looks that way.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/15
msgid ""
"Those bastards are turning their own children into\n"
"junkies? Are they insane?!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/198/0xc6890/16
msgid ""
"No, just afraid. Afraid of a communist Central\n"
"America.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/0
msgid ""
"Amanda! When did you join up with the Sandinistas?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/1
msgid ""
"About a year ago, when I went into the mountains\n"
"with mi viejo and his group.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/2
msgid ""
"I thought your dad was with the FSLN from the\n"
"start.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 3719..5419
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/3
msgid ""
"No. He fought alongside General Sandino, but after\n"
"that he retired for a while.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 5489..6617
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/4
msgid ""
"He found a job, got a wife and a house, and raised\n"
"us kids.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 6715..7453
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/5
msgid ""
"Then one day some Sandinista students came by...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 7481..8345
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/6
msgid ""
"And he felt the old fire in his belly?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 8373..9654
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/7
msgid ""
"Something like that. All he did was help them\n"
"escape from la Guardia, though.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 9710..10295
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/8
msgid ""
"But then la Guardia showed up.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 10407..11549
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/9
msgid ""
"They broke into our house and began pushing him\n"
"around, shouting questions.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 11591..12301
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/10
msgid ""
"I'm guessing he kept his mouth shut.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 12343..13681
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/11
msgid ""
"No matter how hard they hit him. Our house was\n"
"trashed.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 13778..14935
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/12
msgid ""
"After that, he was on their list - they harassed him\n"
"day and night.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 15032..15966
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/13
msgid ""
"It was only then that he gave himself over to the\n"
"Sandinistas.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 16063..17010
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/14
msgid ""
"He kept it hidden from us at first, so we would not\n"
"get hurt.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 17387..17916
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/15
msgid ""
"He sounds like a good father.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_amd0160_000_0
#. timeline 18000..19964
#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/16
msgid ""
"He was... But my mother got fed up with it. She left\n"
"us. I don't blame her.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/17
msgid ""
"Why didn't you go with her?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/18
msgid ""
"It was a hard decision, for sure.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/19
msgid ""
"But like my father, I couldn't let Somoza get away\n"
"with his crimes. But most of all...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/20
#: codec/1/210/0xd2620/0
msgid ""
"Chico.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/21
msgid ""
"...He is too much like his papá. One way or the\n"
"other he was going to stay.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/22
msgid ""
"And I could not leave him behind.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/23
msgid ""
"Soon enough la Guardia drove us out, and we\n"
"found ourselves in the mountains...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/24
msgid ""
"It just kind of happened\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/25
msgid ""
"For an accidental revolutionary, you sure put up a\n"
"hell of a fight.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/26
msgid ""
"The mountains make men into warriors. The\n"
"training is harsh,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/27
msgid ""
"but it brings us that much closer to being hombres\n"
"nuevos.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/28
msgid ""
"Chico couldn't ask for a better sister.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/199/0xc76f0/29
msgid ""
"I can see why they picked you to be comandante.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/0
msgid ""
"When I was little, I came down with malaria.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/1
msgid ""
"Unlucky for me, it was the bad kind. I was in a\n"
"daze the whole time,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/2
msgid ""
"and at one point they said I was not going to make\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/3
msgid ""
"Malarial encephalopathy. I hear it's pretty common\n"
"in tropical malaria cases.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/4
msgid ""
"Even today, my memory sometimes gets a little\n"
"fuzzy.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/5
msgid ""
"Since then I've had this fear of mosquitoes... When\n"
"I hear them buzzing nearby, I get jumpy.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/6
msgid ""
"That explains the chain-smoking?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/7
msgid ""
"Si. I thought it might help keep the mosquitoes\n"
"away, just a little.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/8
msgid ""
"Maybe it's all in my head. You're the same way,\n"
"right?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/9
msgid ""
"I will say this - I prefer a cigar over mosquitoes.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/10
msgid ""
"Me, too.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/11
msgid ""
"I've gotta hand it to you. It takes guts to conquer\n"
"your fear like that\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/12
msgid ""
"and live a guerrilla's life in the wild.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/13
msgid ""
"It is nothing. El Che did not let asthma stop him\n"
"from leading the revolution.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8150/14
msgid ""
"Compared to him, I am no hero.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/0
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear about your dad.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/1
msgid ""
"Thank you for saying that... Mi viejo was the leader\n"
"of the frente.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/2
msgid ""
"He was the last of the generation that knew\n"
"General Sandino...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/3
msgid ""
"He saw the General's exploits first-hand as a boy.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/4
msgid ""
"He would tell us stories about it all the time... and\n"
"about how the General was assassinated.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/5
msgid ""
"Did you know he was getting money from the KGB?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/6
msgid ""
"I had some idea... But I did not have the courage to\n"
"confront him about it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/7
msgid ""
"I know it was a painful decision for him to make.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/8
#: codec/1/251/0xfb280/9
msgid ""
"I can imagine.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/9
msgid ""
"Yes, my father was a good man. I loved him as a\n"
"daughter. And his soldiers believed in him.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/10
msgid ""
"Thanks to him, la Frente held together even in the\n"
"worst of times.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc86c0/11
msgid ""
"I don't know if I can ever fill his shoes...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/0
msgid ""
"Chico's 12, right?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/2
msgid ""
"Isn't he a little... short for his age?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/3
msgid ""
"...Malnourishment. Food is hard to come by when\n"
"you're running around in the jungle...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/4
msgid ""
"He's got quite an appetite.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/5
msgid ""
"I know!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/6
msgid ""
"I didn't want him to come in the first place.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/7
msgid ""
"But there was no one to take him in. I had no\n"
"choice but to look after him.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/8
msgid ""
"Don't be so hard on yourself.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/9
msgid ""
"Sometimes it's better for a kid to be with his family\n"
"than far away, in a safe place.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/10
msgid ""
"Thank you...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/11
msgid ""
"Promise me this, though. When your fight is over,\n"
"make sure he gets a proper education.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/12
msgid ""
"Give him a chance to be something other than a\n"
"guerrilla.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/13
msgid ""
"It's not too late to teach him something other than\n"
"fighting.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/14
msgid ""
"OK. I promise.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/15
msgid ""
"...You know what book Chico really likes?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/16
msgid ""
"The \"World Encyclopedia of Mysterious Creatures.\"\n"
"The Loch Ness Monster, the Yeti...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/17
msgid ""
"UMAs. Yeah, I know.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/18
msgid ""
"He's still so much like a boy... I worry about him.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/19
msgid ""
"He'll be fine. I know plenty of grown men who still\n"
"go crazy over UMAs.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/200/0xc8b50/20
msgid ""
"Are... are you serious?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/0
msgid ""
"You've taken such good care of me since you\n"
"saved me from el colibri.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/1
msgid ""
"I want to return the favor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/2
msgid ""
"Just wait until you're healed up. Then we'll talk.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/3
msgid ""
"I appreciate that. But you need all the help you\n"
"can get.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/4
msgid ""
"It might take a while for me to heal completely,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/5
msgid ""
"but I'll be fine once I'm on my feet. Put me in a\n"
"combat unit - I'll pull my weight.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/6
msgid ""
"I wouldn't expect any less from a Sandinista\n"
"comandante.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/7
msgid ""
"Enough flattery.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/8
msgid ""
"But seriously, it does not feel right for me to be\n"
"sitting here while my compas are out risking their\n"
"lives.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/9
msgid ""
"One thing's for sure. Having you out in the field\n"
"would be a big boost to Sandinista morale.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/10
msgid ""
"Of course, our ultimate goal is still the overthrow\n"
"of Somoza.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/11
msgid ""
"But until we get ourselves back in order, we will\n"
"follow your lead, wherever it takes us.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc91f0/12
msgid ""
"Glad to have you on board.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/0
msgid ""
"Amanda, you getting used to Mother Base?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/1
msgid ""
"Yes, it is Heaven compared to living in the\n"
"mountains.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/2
msgid ""
"We're no longer constantly on the run from la\n"
"Guardia or mercenaries.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/3
msgid ""
"Some of the new guys we've recruited used to be\n"
"mercenaries...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/4
msgid ""
"We're getting along. It was difficult at first,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/5
msgid ""
"but once you talk to them you realize we've got\n"
"plenty in common.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/6
msgid ""
"I see. Good to hear.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/7
msgid ""
"We may be enemies, but we're all still human\n"
"beings...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/8
msgid ""
"La CIA's soldiers, la Guardia... The same goes for\n"
"the people of America.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/9
msgid ""
"What's gotten into you?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/10
msgid ""
"Mi viejo got involved with drugs in order to scrape\n"
"together money for la revolución.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/11
msgid ""
"He did whatever the KGB said.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/12
msgid ""
"All for Nicaragua... or so he told himself.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/13
msgid ""
"But I realize now... In the end all he did was help\n"
"poison young people of America.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/15
msgid ""
"...I've made up my mind. Even when I leave Mother\n"
"Base and return to la revolución,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/16
msgid ""
"I will never turn to drugs. Nor will I look to the KGB\n"
"for help.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/17
msgid ""
"If we topple Somoza using the KGB and drug\n"
"money, we will lose the people's hearts.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/18
msgid ""
"So you're choosing a different path from your\n"
"father.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/19
msgid ""
"I still respect him. But I will not do things the way\n"
"he did.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/20
msgid ""
"Well, I'm sure Chico will be glad to hear that.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/21
msgid ""
"Chico is a grown soldier now. I could not face him\n"
"otherwise.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/22
msgid ""
"Well said, Amanda. Those are the words of a true\n"
"comandante.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/201/0xc9700/23
msgid ""
"Stop... I was inspired by the greatest comandante I\n"
"have ever known, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/0
msgid ""
"Amanda, how do I get to the prison camp?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/1
msgid ""
"First head up the narrow mountain path.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/2
msgid ""
"The path will gradually open up, and you'll come to\n"
"a fork in the road.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/3
msgid ""
"Watch yourself up there.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/4
msgid ""
"You'll be lower than the surrounding terrain,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/5
msgid ""
"so if you head down the middle you'll make for an\n"
"easy target.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/6
msgid ""
"Thanks for the heads-up.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca000/7
msgid ""
"Take the leftward path to reach the prison camp.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 431..1030
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/0
msgid ""
"What can you tell me about the prison camp?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 1058..2117
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/1
msgid ""
"Well, it used to be a village - until they took control\n"
"of it.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 2145..3065
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/2
msgid ""
"It is a maze of paths, so watch out for soldiers on\n"
"patrol.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 3301..3956
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/3
msgid ""
"I'll be sure not to stop and say \"hi.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 3984..4931
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/4
msgid ""
"Use the paths carefully and you should be able to\n"
"stay out of view.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 4959..5489
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/5
msgid ""
"Where are they holding Chico?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 5530..6645
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/6
msgid ""
"One of the houses, most likely. You can peek\n"
"through the doors.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 6659..7523
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/7
msgid ""
"Just press <I=ACT> when the Icon appears.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 7718..8735
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/8
msgid ""
"You could also listen to any sounds inside for clues.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 8749..9013
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/9
msgid ""
"Good idea.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 9041..10198
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/10
msgid ""
"Guards will still be on the move while you're looking\n"
"inside. Make sure you don't get caught.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 10212..10407
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/11
msgid ""
"And Snake...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 10421..11187
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/12
msgid ""
"I know. I'll bring him back.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0020_010_0
#. timeline 11201..12051
#: codec/1/202/0xca2d0/13
msgid ""
"Thank you. I know I can count on you.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/0
msgid ""
"Amanda, do you know the way to the rail terminal?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/1
msgid ""
"Remember the locomotive? By the fork in the road\n"
"before the village?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/2
msgid ""
"Yeah, back in the jungle.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/3
msgid ""
"Follow the train tracks from there and you'll come\n"
"to the terminal.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/4
msgid ""
"But there's a plant along the way.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/5
msgid ""
"Disguised as a coffee factory?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/6
msgid ""
"...Yes, it is their drug refining plant. La CIA controls\n"
"it now.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/7
msgid ""
"Cutting through there is the shortest way, but it'll\n"
"be crawling with soldiers.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/8
msgid ""
"If you want go around...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/9
msgid ""
"No, forget it. If that's the shortest way, that's the\n"
"way I'll take.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/10
msgid ""
"Besides, it's one of their bases. It'll be good intel.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/11
msgid ""
"Very good. A number of the guards at the plant\n"
"are positioned on high walkways.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/12
msgid ""
"Be sure to study their movements before you\n"
"advance.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/13
msgid ""
"Or I could just snipe them first...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/14
msgid ""
"The plant's layout is another maze, I'm afraid. Stay\n"
"cool.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/15
msgid ""
"Make your way out of the plant and you'll arrive at\n"
"the terminal.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/16
msgid ""
"You know a lot about this place...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/17
msgid ""
"What are you saying? I've been there before -\n"
"when the KGB ran it - yes,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/18
msgid ""
"but it is not as if I enjoyed it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/19
msgid ""
"No, I just meant you know a lot about how the\n"
"enemy works.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/20
msgid ""
"I hope so.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/21
msgid ""
"Anyway, did you talk to Chico about the terminal?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/22
msgid ""
"He said it's where they transfer the cargo onto\n"
"trucks.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/23
msgid ""
"Meaning the facility is of considerable importance\n"
"to them. Don't get careless.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/24
msgid ""
"I won't.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/25
msgid ""
"By the way,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/26
msgid ""
"I've heard of a shortcut that cuts straight to the\n"
"coffee factory to the east of the village,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/27
msgid ""
"but I've never used it myself. Check it out if you're\n"
"interested.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/202/0xca770/28
msgid ""
"Thanks for the tip.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 445..1226
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/0
msgid ""
"An enemy tank! Is there somewhere you can hide,\n"
"Boss?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 1253..2215
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/1
msgid ""
"There are train cars, but they won't hold up\n"
"against a gun like that.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 2243..2869
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/2
msgid ""
"Even a freight train? Incredible!\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 3009..3887
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/3
msgid ""
"But they'd keep me out of sight - temporarily.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 3914..5196
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/4
msgid ""
"Use them to look for an opportunity to hit its\n"
"treads or the fuel tank at the back, but...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 5196..5781
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/5
msgid ""
"Don't forget about that gun, huh?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 5795..6506
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/6
msgid ""
"Or the soldiers. They may try to flank you.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0040_000_0
#. timeline 6645..8219
#: codec/1/203/0xcb100/8
msgid ""
"You can also stop it by taking out all the soldiers.\n"
"You can do it, Snake!\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 445..1657
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/0
msgid ""
"Amanda, do I have to take the fork in the road\n"
"back to the village?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 1685..2925
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/1
msgid ""
"People say there is a shortcut. Go back to the\n"
"coffee factory entrance,\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 2939..3469
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/2
msgid ""
"then follow the path on the right.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 3496..4082
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/3
msgid ""
"That will take you straight to the village.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 4109..4820
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/4
msgid ""
"They may have increased security in that area,\n"
"though.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 5015..6534
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/5
msgid ""
"Not surprising, after what happened with the tank.\n"
"What do I do once I'm back at the village?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 6561..8010
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/6
msgid ""
"Destroy the barricade at the north side. From\n"
"there you can reconnect with the transport route.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 8024..8874
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/7
msgid ""
"Hmm... I'll need C4 for that.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 8888..9738
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/8
msgid ""
"The explosion will bring everyone running too.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 9766..10727
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/9
msgid ""
"There's probably going to be a fight - one way or\n"
"the other.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 10755..11730
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/10
msgid ""
"They might not see you if you stick to the\n"
"narrower pathways.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 11800..12552
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/11
msgid ""
"Then just climb over any obstacles.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0050_000_0
#. timeline 12566..13583
#: codec/1/203/0xcb450/12
msgid ""
"Don't let your guard down after taking out the\n"
"barricade, either.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 445..1226
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/0
msgid ""
"Chico says there's a bridge north of the village.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 1253..2020
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/1
msgid ""
"Yes, a narrow one - for crossing the pipe.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 2159..2981
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/2
msgid ""
"On the other side of that is the road the trucks\n"
"use,\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 3023..3482
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/3
msgid ""
"though it's collapsed in places.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 3622..4249
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/4
msgid ""
"I'll have nowhere to run if they spot me.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 4263..4792
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/5
msgid ""
"They could be blocking the road, too.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 4820..5182
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/6
msgid ""
"Is there another way?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 5196..5851
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/7
msgid ""
"There is a path along the cliff.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 5879..6993
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/8
msgid ""
"After you cross the bridge, there are ruins of a\n"
"fort on the mountain.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 7049..7704
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/9
msgid ""
"Going through there would be a little easier.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_000_0
#. timeline 7746..8888
#: codec/1/203/0xcb950/10
msgid ""
"Once you come to the end of the mountain path,\n"
"you'll be at the fort.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_010_0
#. timeline 431..1950
#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/0
msgid ""
"That fort was built during the civil war. It seems la\n"
"CIA's troops are occupying it, now.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_010_0
#. timeline 2187..2856
#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/1
msgid ""
"This just gets better and better.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_010_0
#. timeline 2883..3859
#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/2
msgid ""
"They've got gun turrets set up all around, from the\n"
"looks of it.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_010_0
#. timeline 3887..4959
#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/3
msgid ""
"Attract too much attention and you'll really stir up\n"
"the hornet's nest.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_010_0
#. timeline 4973..5558
#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/4
msgid ""
"Maybe I'll try and find a way around.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0060_010_0
#. timeline 5600..6854
#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/5
msgid ""
"You could always commandeer one of the turrets -\n"
"a little target practice, perhaps?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/6
msgid ""
"Just like Krasnogorje.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/7
msgid ""
"Krasno-what?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/203/0xcbd00/8
msgid ""
"Sorry, just... thinking about old times.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/0
msgid ""
"Watch out! It's el galápago!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/1
msgid ""
"It reduces its body weight by blasting air\n"
"underneath it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/2
msgid ""
"That makes it a lot faster than any tank. It also\n"
"has a tight turning radius.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/3
msgid ""
"Any weak points?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/4
msgid ""
"Taking out its boosters could reduce its\n"
"acceleration...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/5
msgid ""
"You could also try destroying its machine guns.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/6
msgid ""
"I'll give it a shot.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/204/0xcc050/7
msgid ""
"We've lost many compas to that thing. Send it to\n"
"the scrapyard!\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 459..1894
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/0
msgid ""
"From here on in you'll be in a cloud forest. The\n"
"ground is covered in vegetation.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 1922..2897
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/1
msgid ""
"You'll have plenty of hiding places, but so will the\n"
"enemy.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 2925..3496
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/2
msgid ""
"I'll keep an eye out for scouts.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 3524..4360
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/3
msgid ""
"Trying to force your way through would be suicide.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 4388..5377
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/4
msgid ""
"Know the enemy's location before making any\n"
"moves.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 5405..6004
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/5
msgid ""
"Too bad you don't have some sort of radar.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 6227..6715
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/6
msgid ""
"I could try night vision.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 6729..7843
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/7
msgid ""
"Once you know where an enemy is, decide how you\n"
"want to handle him.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 7871..8373
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/8
msgid ""
"You could get into his blindspots...\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 8414..9626
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/9
msgid ""
"Or drop him from a distance before he even has a\n"
"clue someone's around.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_amd0080_000_0
#. timeline 9640..10267
#: codec/1/204/0xcc320/10
msgid ""
"An eye for an eye, right?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0
#. timeline 431..1323
#: codec/1/204/0xcc700/0
msgid ""
"Don't even think about facing a chopper head-on.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0
#. timeline 1351..2145
#: codec/1/204/0xcc700/1
msgid ""
"Guerilla tactics would work well in a place like that.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e3bb338 voice v_bri_mis_amd0090_000_0
#. timeline 2159..3357
#: codec/1/204/0xcc700/2
msgid ""
"Moving from tree to tree will make it hard to get a\n"
